1
00:06:22,857 --> 00:06:28,857
This is a fight for our very existence.

2
00:12:45,714 --> 00:12:51,714
The Creator is a science fiction, action, adventure
film directed by Gareth Edwards.

3
00:19:08,571 --> 00:19:14,571
Amid a future war between the human race and the forces of artificial intelligence, a hardened ex-special forces agent grieving the disappearance of his wife, is recruited to
hunt down and kill the Creator, the elusive architect of advanced AI who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war—and mankind itself.

4
00:25:31,428 --> 00:25:37,428
Joshua, played by John David Washington.

5
00:31:54,285 --> 00:32:00,285
Alphie, played by Madeleine Yuna Voyles.

6
00:38:17,142 --> 00:38:23,142
Maya, played by Gemma Chan.

7
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:46,000
Colonel Howell, played by Allison Janney.

8
00:51:02,857 --> 00:51:08,857
Harun, played by Ken Watanabe.

9
00:57:25,714 --> 00:57:31,714
Drew, played by Sturgill Simpson.

10
01:03:48,571 --> 01:03:54,571
The Creator is a 2023 American science fiction action film produced and directed
by Gareth Edwards, who co-wrote the screenplay with Chris Weitz.

11
01:10:11,428 --> 01:10:17,428
It stars John David Washington, Gemma Chan, Ken
Watanabe, Sturgill Simpson, and Allison Janney.

12
01:16:34,285 --> 01:16:40,285
Set in 2070, 15 years after artificial intelligence (AI) set off a nuclear detonation in Los Angeles, which started a war of humans against AI, a former
special forces agent is recruited to hunt down and kill the "Creator", who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war.

13
01:22:57,142 --> 01:23:03,142
Development began in November 2019 when Edwards signed on to direct and write the
project for New Regency and was officially announced in February 2020.

14
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:26,000
Washington was hired in May 2021, and the rest of
the cast joined over the next year.

15
01:35:42,857 --> 01:35:48,857
Filming began in January 2022 in Thailand with an $80
million production budget, and wrapped that May.

16
01:42:05,714 --> 01:42:11,714
The Creator was released in North America on
September 29, 2023, by 20th Century Studios.

17
01:48:28,571 --> 01:48:34,571
The film grossed $104.3 million worldwide and received
generally positive reviews from critics.

18
01:54:51,428 --> 01:54:57,428
It had two nominations at the 96th Academy Awards, for Best Visual Effects and Best Sound, and was nominated
for Best Science Fiction Film and Best Film Visual / Special Effects at the 51st Saturn Awards.

19
02:01:14,285 --> 02:01:20,285
The film explores themes of artificial intelligence
(a.i.), asia, cyberpunk, robot, space station.

20
02:07:37,142 --> 02:07:43,142
The tone is thought_provoking.
